{"v":4,"catch":"化身真正反派，在黑暗RPG中改寫命運！","desc":"普通青年轉生到最愛的漫畫世界，卻成為注定死亡的小反派。為了改變命運，他必須成為真正的反派，集結夥伴、對抗英雄，在這款黑暗幻想異世界JRPG中開創全新道路。體驗一段關於生存、背叛與野心的故事，在像素風世界中見證善與惡的對抗。\n\n體驗融合經典指令與現代機制的策略回合制戰鬥。利用敵人弱點，觸發連鎖攻擊並施展強力破防技能。透過惡行累積惡名提升階級，並在技能樹中解鎖獨特能力。探索地下城、收集資源，打造專屬邪惡據點，包括鍛造屋、實驗室、走私等設施。像素風格魅力十足，劇情沉浸且具策略深度，是JRPG與奇幻玩家不可錯過的作品。","publisher":"KEMCO","release":"2026-06-05","genres":["角色扮演","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 1.7GB / Switch 1.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1efb696a429caccce6c8646464b02d964a1c394183aa334b40d60faa1e9aa639.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25e6949567281cf179b4b3e6411ae3269107c032f6c41eeb9f4ff376b5f472c8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2ad0643c748273d92da3a07653e4b14847dac63f36cb19bfa247cd9912fd7edc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/15a7c130b70677434f6429791e2260908ddf6261c999e9dfffba4cc64e8e9fea.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9eeb354e7c1357de072d90e03d0d7ad80f504f54be2ab1d28e82a85d68c2c763.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f9b45f84d1c42212c1ee43c9b5135c67279b1d7deb01ff7987bfebc24e5034cb.jpg"],"titleId":"01008f70272c2000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000074232","name":"Experience x3 - Isekai Villain","img":"39fbab418801a48f7a85d93d020c68a3cb52008db591a9d232f42256bd9cb717","date":"2026-06-05","mem":false},{"id":"70050000074233","name":"Damage x2 - Isekai Villain","img":"f23d62746e949f71736369ed5937952f9265f417881514af9bdd19df7d9a38ac","date":"2026-06-05","mem":false},{"id":"70050000074234","name":"No Skill Cost - Isekai Villain","img":"d93347513b04e1121d49b998c4e7374508bdb34b46d9f9c4513664715003a6af","date":"2026-06-05","mem":false}],"vids":["Owczb-92_GA"]}